        <AnnotationLayout
          Text="Package: s3_LoadFactSales&#xA;Purpose: Load FactSales by resolving all surrogate keys from the 4 dimensions.&#xA;Run order: 1) Truncate FactSales -&gt; 2) Data Flow Task&#xA;Grain: One row per order line item (BusinessKey = SalesOrderDetailID).&#xA;Dependency: All S3 dimension packages (DimProduct, DimCustomer, DimTerritory) must complete first.&#xA;Note: Facts are immutable — no SCD check needed. Re-run = full TRUNCATE + reload."
          ParentId="Package"
          FontInfo="{assembly:Null}"
          Size="560,136"
          Id="a1b2c3d4-1001-1002-1003-400000000001"
          TopLeft="30,295" />
        <AnnotationLayout
          Text="Clears FactSales before each full reload.&#xA;Re-run strategy: TRUNCATE + reload (facts are immutable historical records)."
